2026-10-08T12:35:07.3874821Z [36;1m# `main` entry point — before the executable-root elaboration runs,[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3875316Z [36;1m# and the link then dies with `ld.lld: error: undefined symbol:[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3875748Z [36;1m# main`. Seen 2026-09-09 after months of the combined command[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3876196Z [36;1m# passing; the build order in a good run is Main → Main → Main:c.o,[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3876646Z [36;1m# in the bad one Main → Main:c.o → Main.[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3876932Z [36;1mbuild_all() {[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3877167Z [36;1m  lake build FlareOperator \[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3877449Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_operator \[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3877729Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_unit \[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3877992Z [36;1m    && lake build flare_e2e[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3878235Z [36;1m}[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3878518Z [36;1m# Retry once from a CLEAN tree. The runner's clang also dies with[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3878971Z [36;1m# SIGBUS (exit 135) occasionally (two consecutive otherwise-green[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3879422Z [36;1m# runs); a plain retry would re-link whatever partial objects the[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3879870Z [36;1m# first attempt left behind and fail the same way, so wipe them.[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3880321Z [36;1m# A real compile error fails both attempts and still fails the job.[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3880694Z [36;1mbuild_all || {[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3881017Z [36;1m  echo "::warning::lake build failed — cleaning and retrying once"[0m
2026-10-08T12:35:07.3881367Z [36;1m  lake clean[0m
